> absorb2_A(a: bool, b: bool) = a
> absorb2_B(a: bool, b: bool) = a | (a & b)
> equiv absorb2_A ~ absorb2_B
absorb2_A and absorb2_B are equal on the domain of absorb2_A (exhaustive)
> absorb3_A(a: bool, b: bool, c: bool) = a
> absorb3_B(a: bool, b: bool, c: bool) = a & (a | b | c)
> equiv absorb3_A ~ absorb3_B
absorb3_A and absorb3_B are equal on the domain of absorb3_A (exhaustive)
> distrib1_A(a: bool, b: bool, c: bool) = a & (b | c)
> distrib1_B(a: bool, b: bool, c: bool) = (a & b) | (a & c)
> equiv distrib1_A ~ distrib1_B
distrib1_A and distrib1_B are equal on the domain of distrib1_A (exhaustive)
> distrib2_A(a: bool, b: bool, c: bool) = a | (b & c)
> distrib2_B(a: bool, b: bool, c: bool) = (a | b) & (a | c)
> equiv distrib2_A ~ distrib2_B
distrib2_A and distrib2_B are equal on the domain of distrib2_A (exhaustive)
> idem1_A(a: bool) = a
> idem1_B(a: bool) = a & a
> equiv idem1_A ~ idem1_B
idem1_A and idem1_B are equal on the domain of idem1_A (exhaustive)
> idem2_A(a: bool) = a
> idem2_B(a: bool) = a | a
> equiv idem2_A ~ idem2_B
idem2_A and idem2_B are equal on the domain of idem2_A (exhaustive)
> compl1_A(a: bool) = 0
> compl1_B(a: bool) = a & !a
> equiv compl1_A ~ compl1_B
compl1_A and compl1_B are equal on the domain of compl1_A (exhaustive)
> compl2_A(a: bool) = 1
> compl2_B(a: bool) = a | !a
> equiv compl2_A ~ compl2_B
compl2_A and compl2_B are equal on the domain of compl2_A (exhaustive)
